  "description": "Marianne’s husband loved her twin sister, Gloria, more than he loved her. She discovers that the two have been having an affair in her own home. Furious, she throws Gloria out and decides to divorce her husband. But the next day, everyone suddenly believes that Marianne is Gloria, the mad widow who stole her sister’s husband. Her husband has taken away her name, her identity, and her place as his wife. Then, Gloria’s husband, who was believed to be dead, suddenly returns. What will Marianne do now that her life has been stolen from her?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
